#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673552"
msgid "Is there a checkpoint in that area?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674080"
msgid "Luckily, the Labyrinth doesn't end here.\nI should start by walking around where I can."
msgstr ""

