#. inDungeon
msgctxt "674584"
msgid "Trust your anger to my blade. Lancer is close by."
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "674640"
msgid "…well, speak of the devil. Brace yourself, Master.\nThe enemy is near."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674944"
msgid "After the feeling of a drowsy intoxication wears off,\nwe find ourselves in a strange space."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675548"
msgid "By measuring every number that composes you,\nwe're preventing the collapse of\nyour significance, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676040"
msgid "Though we can't scan the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF,\nwe can substitute you as a monitoring\ndevice to survey the surroundings."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676592"
msgid "…that's likely, I think. But… how\nstrange… Despite how large these bio-signs\nare, I can't read any ID."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676868"
msgid "That said, all that WE can do is\nfix the camera on you and monitor\nyour situation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "677680"
msgid "Hmph… I was cautious, wondering how buggy\nthis would all be, but this is it?\nI was scared for nothing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "678976"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF urges me forward."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "679156"
msgid "I've been listening―so this is that\n\"Arena\" place."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "679848"
msgid "Will I be able to handle a Servant\nso severely egotistical…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "680268"
msgid "Oho, that's an #C000246204Enemy Program#CDEF, isn't it?\n#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, do you remember how to fight?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "680384"
msgid "Yep, I forgot!"
msgstr ""

#. popupYesNo_line1
msgctxt "680432"
msgid "Would you like to"
msgstr ""

#. popupYesNo_line2
msgctxt "680460"
msgid "skip the battle tutorial?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "680656"
msgid "If a Servant's strength gives out,\nso too will their Master's life force."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "681176"
msgid "Take, for instance, this enemy here.\nThe only move it can make\nis the powerful #C000246204BREAK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "681404"
msgid "So in this case, you should be able to win\nif all you do is #C000246204ATTACK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "681528"
msgid "……did you get all of that?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "681560"
msgid "I'll give it a try."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "681928"
msgid "…so that's how it is.\nYou were left with a Servant to COPE with,\nnot breeze through with."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "682200"
msgid "……?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "683304"
msgid "Because I'm in a similar position."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "683652"
msgid "That just now was him weakened?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "683684"
msgid "Wait, doesn't this mean we're in a pinch?\nWhy is this Servant even more smug than usual!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "684392"
msgid "Ah, but this is what they call a bond?\nWe've found common ground. This means\nwe've both hit rock-bottom!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "684828"
msgid "―――Is this true?\n#C236196003Gawain#CDEF is perfectly normal, though…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "686444"
msgid "Uhm… Noble Phantasms aside, it's true\nthat #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF's Servant has been reset."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "686820"
msgid "Why!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "686832"
msgid "What part!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "687516"
msgid "Hrm."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "687524"
msgid "…hmph."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "687536"
msgid "…well, it IS as you say…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "687724"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF reluctantly assents to #C236196003Leo#CDEF's words."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "687956"
msgid "Anyway, let's press on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "687984"
msgid "#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF nods approvingly at #C236196003Leo#CDEF's words."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "688224"
msgid "Anyway, let's press on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "688868"
msgid "Ah……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "688880"
msgid "Hm? What's the matter, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "689384"
msgid "The enemy before you can only use\nthe move #C000246204ATTACK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "689468"
msgid "#C000246204ATTACK#CDEF is a quick and reliable movement.\n……but it leaves an opening after execution."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "689584"
msgid "In that case, use #C000246204GUARD#CDEF to resist it\nand aim for a counterattack."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "689756"
msgid "Good work. Seems there's no issue."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "690436"
msgid "But, no matter how much it defends,\nit will fall before the might of #C000246204BREAK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "690540"
msgid "And now for practice.\nI've grown quite bored of talking,\nso please fight with #C000246204BREAK#CDEF already."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "690792"
msgid "The swift #C000246204ATTACK#CDEF beats the long wind-up\nof a #C000246204BREAK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "691008"
msgid "With a #C000246204GUARD#CDEF, you can protect yourself from\nan #C000246204ATTACK#CDEF and deliver a counter."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "692196"
msgid "Aside from that, your Servant can use\npowerful #C000246204Skills#CDEF unique to them."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "694072"
msgid "In the [#C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF],"
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line2
msgctxt "694120"
msgid "press the □ button to use items."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd
msgctxt "694156"
msgid "The same goes for Code Casts."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "694208"
msgid "A sturdy door blocks our way."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "694408"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF.\nWhat does this \"☆\" symbol mean?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "694468"
msgid "T-this is also the first time I've seen this.\nSecurity levels are just like Servant\nparameters."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "694576"
msgid "The strongest security level is A.\nThe weakest is E. There's one exception, EX,\nbut…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "694664"
msgid "A \"☆\" category doesn't exist.\nOne moment. I'll analyze what #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF\nis seeing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "694768"
msgid "With this much visual data,\nwe can even scan from here…\nNo way―unable to measure…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "695016"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF shrieks in astonishment."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "695192"
msgid "―――Leave the wall for later.\n#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF. The surrounding\nSpiritrons are growing wildly unstable."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "695352"
msgid "#C236196003Julius#CDEF―――!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "695476"
msgid "There―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "695492"
msgid "Lousy Master and lackey there. That's far\nenough. Could you paupers NOT go staring into\npeople's minds, please?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "695792"
msgid "Is that not―――#C236196003Rin#CDEF!\nWhy is she here!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "695968"
msgid "Oh? Is that #C236196003Rin#CDEF? Yoo-hoo, long time no…\nI suppose now is not the time.\nThis dark aura is not normal."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "696196"
msgid "Yeah, she's #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "696440"
msgid "Not \"as if.\" I AM.\nYou're as insipid a #[man][girl]# as ever."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "696516"
msgid "I don't exactly disagree, but in any case, wait!\n#C236196003Rin#CDEF, is this YOUR castle!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "696940"
msgid "That's what I'm telling you.\nI'm the queen of this castle,\nand the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF's new ruler―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "697620"
msgid "That aside, #C236196003Rin#CDEF is the #C000246204Queen of the Moon#CDEF…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "698492"
msgid "Gosh, you really are an idiot, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "698564"
msgid "All you had to do was hide in the school,\nbut instead you strolled in like a turtle\nwaiting to be stomped on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "698768"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF is serious…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "698808"
msgid "While licking her lips, she raises an arm threateningly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "698972"
msgid "Is #C236196003Lancer#CDEF coming!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "699008"
msgid "#C236196003Lancer#CDEF, yes? Bring it on!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "699380"
msgid "What…? N-no, this is no ordinary bloodlust…!\nStep back, #RUBS  Master#RUBEPraetor#REND!\nShe's dangerous!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "699580"
msgid "…!\nPlease stand back #RUBS  Master#RUBEDarling#REND.\nThis girl is raring to kill!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "699764"
msgid "Hee hee… Not bad. I like you.\nThis means I'll be having an excellent main\ndish today."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "700040"
msgid "Don't answer, Master.\nNothing comes of talking to a bunch like that.\nNo need to, anyway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "700132"
msgid "\"Pig\"!? Are you calling me F-A-T, you bitch!?\nDon't get all cocky just because you look young!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "700244"
msgid "P-pig……!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "700588"
msgid "No way, what's going on…?\nI was told that in this world,\neverything would go my way!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "702008"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, close your gaping mouth. There's no\nneed for surprise. They say Servants look like\ntheir Masters."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "702132"
msgid "Of course, this is no time to be stunned."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "702312"
msgid "Challenge them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "702476"
msgid "Agreed!\nI was waiting for those words from you!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "702812"
msgid "Paupers should be out eating straw.\nYou two have no business being on my stage!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "702928"
msgid "Guh―she knew about our reset levels…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "703652"
msgid "Endure it for now, right #RUBS  Master#RUBEPraetor#REND?\nWise, but this Servant's bloodlust is alien.\nEscape will prove harsh."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "703872"
msgid "…I would refuse to turn tail on that horned\ngirl, but this is our only choice.\nLet's regroup and rematch her another time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "704572"
msgid "Huh? I haven't moved an inch.\n………they're gone.\n#C236196003Rin#CDEF, you're an idiot."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "706316"
msgid "It would be #[great][nice]# if that building held a clue…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "706980"
msgid "How awful…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "707116"
msgid "At a glance, they appear to be human, but…\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF, which are they? NPCs or Masters?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "707460"
msgid "Uuh… aah… So sleepy… tired…\nIs… someone there…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "707972"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF is staring morosely at these pinned people."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "708132"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF stares coldly at the bloodstained torture chamber."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "708288"
msgid "U-uaa… ah… ah…\nGive… it back… Please… no more.\nI'll stay, here forever, just give…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "708456"
msgid "My―\nGive me back my abilitieessss!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "708716"
msgid "…the reverse of a designer baby.\nIn this room, geniuses are physically turned\ninto commonfolk."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "709256"
msgid "But…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "710040"
msgid "…how unexpected. To think my Master would\nreaffirm themselves before a prison like\nthis."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "710212"
msgid "Your anger is justified. Be shameless in bashing\nthat Servant's head in."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "710408"
msgid "…for me, I hold no indignation over this.\nI am unqualified to feel such.\nHowever―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "710508"
msgid "However, if my Darling were to ever meet with\nthis fate, I would likely turn into a wrathful\nmonster."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "711296"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF's voice loosens my strained mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "711608"
msgid "#C236196003Julius#CDEF is right."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "713544"
msgid "Is that… #C236196003Rin#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "713704"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF!?\nWh-why are you―when did you trespass here!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "713868"
msgid "! Please be careful, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF!\nA Servant is… not detected?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "714056"
msgid "So, like…\nI'm not going easy on you or anything!!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "714792"
msgid "Signs of #C236196003Rin#CDEF have stopped near the Shield.\nPresently, I cannot measure beyond that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "715280"
msgid "Kyaaaaaaa!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "715304"
msgid "!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "715336"
msgid "No, nooooo!\nI beg you, spare me! I won't run anymore!\nPlease don't stab me with that…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "715632"
msgid "But… No, stooop!\nI'll vanish,\nI'll vanish this time, so…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "715992"
msgid "As we ran in, we saw the figure of that red\n#C236196003Lancer#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "716236"
msgid "No signs of a Master! This is your chance,\n#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "716716"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, is that truly Lancer?\nIs this not a mixup with Berserker?\nOr a new type of rare class?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "717000"
msgid "What? You. Cease your talking.\nIt's poor #RUBS   manners#RUBEetiquette#REND. \nWhere do you think you are?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "717108"
msgid "#C236196003Lancer#CDEF points at us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "717152"
msgid "This question seemed to be for #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF\nrather than for #C236196003#SVT#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "717628"
msgid "Well, we were not to talk……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "717952"
msgid "A cute bunny is what I just ripped to shreds."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "718088"
msgid "…so I did.\nI definitely said so, yes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "718132"
msgid "……\n……………\n……………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "718192"
msgid "Silence fell."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "719092"
msgid "Jeez, this girl has such a short fuse…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "720780"
msgid "#C236196003Lancer#CDEF's attack power surpassed ours."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "721984"
msgid "…#C236196003Rin#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "722456"
msgid "Eh? Anything else?\nUhm………… no.\nI didn't blurt out a thing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "722948"
msgid "You just told them everything!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "722980"
msgid "You're wrong, it's not my fault.\nThat #[piggy Master][squirrel Master]# is simply expert-level in\nleading questions."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "723680"
msgid "――――――."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "724108"
msgid "What the hell is this Servant thinking…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "724428"
msgid "No way! #C236196003Rin#CDEF…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "725036"
msgid "By #C236196003Rin#CDEF's command, #C236196003Lancer#CDEF left readily.\nShe probably went back to their base."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "725232"
msgid "For whatever reason, she rescued me out of this big pinch."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "725956"
msgid "Don't you DAAARE get me wrong!\nI'm not thinking about you in the slightest!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "726220"
msgid "Ohh boyy…. #C236196003Rin#CDEF, you really are something…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "726364"
msgid "This is―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "726380"
msgid "…it's here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "726476"
msgid "My left hand throbs with a \"thump.\"\nThe #RUBS   program#RUBEtechnique#REND #C236196003Kiara#CDEF transferred to me rumbles."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "726672"
msgid "Ah―――So then, this is―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "726868"
msgid "#C000246204SG#CDEF confirmed! That is what will break the\nShield, #C236196003Rin#CDEF's secret!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "726968"
msgid "I knew it…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "727076"
msgid "Yes, I didn't dash towards #C236196003Rin#CDEF;\nI was simply pulled into her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "727980"
msgid "But the battle starts here. I'm just one quarter\nof the whole. A little thing like this doesn't\nhurt me at all, see?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "728100"
msgid "Just a quarter of the whole…?\nWhat on Earth is #C236196003Rin#CDEF talking about…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "729404"
msgid "Well, this one was fairly obvious.\nA splendidly textbook template."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "729576"
msgid "Alas… I cannot fathom your culture at all,\neveryone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "729772"
msgid "It is short for \"#C000246204Secret Garden#CDEF.\" Since it is\na name registered in the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF's libraries,\nwe will shorten it to #C000246204SG#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "730124"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, #C000246204please head past the shield#CDEF.\nAfter that, return to base."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "731072"
msgid "Access to the #C000246204SG#CDEF menu granted."
msgstr ""

