msgctxt "748284"
msgid "Don't press."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line2
msgctxt "748300"
msgid "#TVAL02 Sm#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1659
msgctxt "748320"
msgid "　You cannot carry any more\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF."
msgstr "　Você não pode carregar mais\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF."

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "748376"
msgid "After making a shortcut to the old school from\nthe #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF, please return to base."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "748480"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, you appear to have accumulated\na lot of fatigue. I recommend that\nyou return for the moment to take a rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "748616"
msgid "I'm concerned about #C236196003Rin#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "748660"
msgid "Searching the Labyrinth is nice and all,\nbut I should #C000246204return to the old school#CDEF to\nbriefly speak with #C236196003Kiara#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "748800"
msgid "I obtained the first #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nLet's briefly return to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and sort\nout the situation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "748920"
msgid "First thing to do is activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF.\nThat'll help move our search along."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "749020"
msgid "We took more damage from our fight with #C236196003Lancer#CDEF\nthan I expected. Now would be a good time to head\nback to the old school.\nLuckily, there's a #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF near us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "749212"
msgid "What's wrong, Praetor?\nLet's #C000246204continue onward#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "749276"
msgid "Don't worry. I'll protect you, Darling.\nSo, continue on #C000246204ahead#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "749356"
msgid "Surely you're not telling me that you're\nfrightened? Even you understand that stopping\nhere is impermissible, yes?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "749472"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. After you activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF,\nplease have yourself a rest in your\nprivate room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "749600"
msgid "Even in cyberspace, you need proper rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "749644"
msgid "Once you activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF,\nuse it to get back here.\nI'll bet you're exhausted, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "749772"
msgid "#[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF, return to base for now.\nLet's discuss our plan\nin the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "749900"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, please come back.\nYou've accumulated a lot of fatigue;\nany more will be dangerous!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "750008"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF's worried state gets across to\nme even over the transmission."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "750096"
msgid "She's right, it would be best if\nwe returned to the #C000246204Old School Building#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "750188"
msgid "We obtained the #C000246204SG#CDEF. Let's return to the\n#C000246204Old School Building#CDEF for the time being.\nWe can come again after we recover."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "750336"
msgid "We got the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nMission complete.\nLet's head home and get some rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "750420"
msgid "Where are you going? We secured the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nThere's nothing urgent to tend to.\nBack to #C000246204My Room#CDEF, now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "750552"
msgid "Hrrrm? Where are you going, #C236196003#FAMILY\n#GIVEN#CDEF? Where are you going,\nleaving me behind?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "750652"
msgid "For a second there, I was thinking about\nleaving #C236196003Gatou#CDEF and heading back,\nbut it probably won't rest easy on my conscience,\nso let's turn back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "750812"
msgid "Wait, Praetor. If we're going to head back,\nit'll behoove us for the future to have\nthe #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF activated."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "750940"
msgid "Master, let's look for the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF.\nIt should be around here somewhere…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "751032"
msgid "We don't need to walk all the way back.\nWe can use the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF to reach the\nold school in a flash. Very nifty."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "751164"
msgid "M-my stomach is at its limit…\nI want to hurry back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and get some rest…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "751264"
msgid "Before we go to the next floor,\nlet's #C000246204head back to the Student Council Room#CDEF.\nWe need to hand over the data we got from #C236196003Green Archer#CDEF.\nHe gave his life to entrust us with it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "751472"
msgid "Huh? You're still in the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF?\nCome on, there's nothing to do there.\nGet your butt back here!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "751596"
msgid "We'll talk about what comes next tomorrow,\nso #C000246204come back and get some rest#CDEF.\nAfter, drop by the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "751728"
msgid "We're in a race against time.\nWe need to hurry to the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "751820"
msgid "I can't let #C236196003Shinji#CDEF's hopes go to waste.\nLet's press on so we can catch up to #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "751944"
msgid "Praetor, I've grown tired. Let us return\nto My Room and have ourselves a bath."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "752024"
msgid "I know how you feel, but knowing\nwhen to rest is also part of the battle.\nLet's head back to My Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "752128"
msgid "Darling, now is the time for rest.\nLet's return to our room and\nrecover our strength."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "752216"
msgid "What an impatient #[man][woman]#. Laboring away\nis not all there is to life, you know?\nWhen it's time to rest, rest."
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "752336"
msgid "You may now save your current game data\n            as #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."
msgstr "Agora você pode salvar seus dados\n         como #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "752420"
msgid "     You may use this data to carry\nover elements to the start of a new game."
msgstr "     Você pode usar esses dados para levar\nelementos ao início de um novo jogo."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "752500"
msgid "Please be careful to not overwrite\n  the data while you are saving."
msgstr "Tome cuidado para não sobrescrever\n  os dados ao salvar."

#. unk_op1653
msgctxt "752568"
msgid "Would you like to save your Clear Data?"
msgstr "Deseja salvar seus Clear Data?"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line1
msgctxt "752608"
msgid "Are you sure you wish to exit"
msgstr "Tem certeza de que deseja sair"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line2
msgctxt "752640"
msgid "without saving the Clear Data?"
msgstr "sem salvar os Clear Data?"

#. choice
msgctxt "752672"
msgid "It's okay, I think I got it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "752704"
msgid "It's fine to admit it.\nWell then, let's go over the basics."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "752764"
msgid "Touching the enemy will initiate the battle.\nThe one actually engaging the enemy will not be\nyou, but rather your Servant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "752888"
msgid "Next, let's review the combat mechanics."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "752932"
msgid "There are three basic actions that you\nand your opponent can do.\nThey are #C000246204ATTACK#CDEF, #C000246204GUARD#CDEF, and #C000246204BREAK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "753080"
msgid "Out of these three attacks,\nyou may command your Servant\nto make six actions each turn."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "753168"
msgid "Your Servant will then fight accordingly.\nIf neither side has won within six moves,\nthen another turn will begin. That's about it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "753300"
msgid "……how do you decide\non which moves to make?\nIt's nothing to be worried about."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "753380"
msgid "The damage would be immense if it hit.\nHowever, you can stop it in its tracks\nwith #C000246204ATTACK#CDEF while it's winding up."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "753512"
msgid "Tell me one more time!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "753536"
msgid "Yes, that's fine then. #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF\nmay think there's no problem, but it's\nsurely been a while. Please be careful."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "753664"
msgid "Understood.\nIt wouldn't do to rush into things, after all.\nOnce again, let's take it from the top."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "753764"
msgid "Impressive. Well then,\nlet's commence with the extermination."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "753828"
msgid "Ugh… How can this be?\nI had no idea my power had weakened so much.\nIt's been sealed to this extent!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "753932"
msgid "No way! I've become THIS weak!? Agghh!\nAfter I worked so hard to get my little Black\nHeaven Hollow! Come back to me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "754052"
msgid "I'm thoroughly debilitated.\nIt WAS a 2,000 year slumber, after all.\nI suppose it won't be so easy to wake up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "754164"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF is acting strange.\nAfter defeating this hostile program so gallantly,\nall I see is a look of defeat."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "754288"
msgid "Praetor. I have bad news. First, the skills\nI gained alongside you―――\nI no longer have any of them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "754392"
msgid "And that's not all.\nI can't move my body as nimbly as I want to!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "754460"
msgid "Agh! I made light of this because it was cute!\nTHIS is what the Restraints were designed for!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "754556"
msgid "…Master, listen calmly. We've lost all of our\nexperience points. I've returned to my initial\nlevel from when I was summoned."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "754684"
msgid "This may be an effect of the Restraints.\nActually, I did think that something was off,\nbut this reason makes sense."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "754800"
msgid "…this may sound bad, but while we might\nnot know what dropped us to the #C000246204Far Side of\nthe Moon#CDEF, I feel a little relieved."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "754940"
msgid "If we're up against some maniac who forces\npeople to wear this stuff just to show off out\nof a whim, then we've got headaches ahead."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "755076"
msgid "Uugh. This is the worst mistake of my life…\nI never thought I would be reduced to less than\none tail's worth of divinity again…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "755208"
msgid "The skill experience I gathered little by\nlittle, the proof of love between me and\nDarling, has reverted to its initial value!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "755336"
msgid "Sob, sob. This is because of the Restraints…\nperhaps? Hm. I'd say half, the other half\nmight be some other drain effect, I think."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "755468"
msgid "―――Now then.\n#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, listen here with a smile."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "755536"
msgid "A millennium of ennui has hampered me, it seems.\nUnfortunately, I've degraded down to the\nlowest values."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "755644"
msgid "Do not fret so. I dozed within the abyss for\nnearly an eternity. Of course my mind and body\nwill have dulled."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "755756"
msgid "What? This is fortuitous for you. I have\na time-reversing elixir, but to drink it\nand return to normal would be no fun."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "755876"
msgid "I have no intention of mending this\nsaggy flesh by my own hand."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "755940"
msgid "Therefore, rejoice.\nYour present task is to provide therapy\nto the king's body."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "756020"
msgid "Devote your full capacity as a Master\ntowards rehabilitating me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "756088"
msgid "Wha―――what on Earth is he saying!?\nI understood what he meant, but there's\nno way I can just say \"sure, okay\"…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "756204"
msgid "Resting so much lowered his levels?\nHe's pushing his rehabilitation onto his Master?\nAnd more, he's saying that I'm supposed to consider all\nthat toil an honor…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "756368"
msgid "Hahaha. I know how you feel, but don't be so in\nawe. I'll pardon your disrespect."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "756452"
msgid "What my Servant told me was unexpected,\nbut I wasn't that surprised."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "756524"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF's skills are gone, and my memory is hazy.\nOne could say we're pretty similar in that regard."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "756640"
msgid "I never asked for that kind of common ground…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "756688"
msgid "Actually, I wonder what's been going on\nwith this Servant recently."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "756756"
msgid "As soon as I think he may be heartless by nature,\nhe starts cheerfully talking about how weak he is,\nand he's not even getting angry…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "756892"
msgid "The golden king who answered my call\nwithin the depths of the abyss: #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "756988"
msgid "It doesn't seem like I'll be able to learn\nabout this Servant's nature through ordinary means."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "757084"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF, I'd like to ask about their #C000246204Noble Phantasm#CDEF.\nSkills aside, is their Noble Phantasm usable?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "757212"
msgid "A #C000246204Noble Phantasm#CDEF.\nA Servant's trump card.\nThe \"proof that one is a Heroic Spirit\"\nwhich reveals one's #C000246204True Name#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "757360"
msgid "All Servants have a legend representing\ntheir origins, which they can treat as a \"weapon.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "757452"
msgid "If they're a famous fencer, they wield a secret sword-technique.\nIf they're a Heroic Spirit in mythology, they wield the miracles\nspoken of in their legend."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "757612"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF is no exception to that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "757660"
msgid "If I recall correctly, #C236196003#SVT#CDEF's Noble Phantasm―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "757728"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF is no exception to that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "757776"
msgid "However, there's no reason to think that\nI should know what #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF's Noble Phantasm is\nsince I just contracted him."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "757912"
msgid "Sorry. I can't use my Noble Phantasm either.\nYOU there! Don't be shocked, saying \"not\nthis again\"! There are reasons!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "758032"
msgid "…my Noble Phantasm has also been sealed.\nThis seems to be due to a coercive\nlock unrelated to the Restraints."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "758144"
msgid "Yes, I've been completely sealed.\nThis is a system-side lock. Another problem on\ntop of these Restraints."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "758252"
msgid "Well, my Noble Phantasm IS \"#C000246204The No. 1 useless\nNoble Phantasm by users' choice#CDEF!\"\nIt doesn't hurt me that much."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "758380"
msgid "My Noble Phantasm? I may have been reset,\nbut it's always within my grasp.\nHowever, it's too much for you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "758488"
msgid "I only draw my collection's treasured sword\nfor worthy foes and battles. It's hardly\nlikely that you'll ever see it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "758608"
msgid "…this is troubling. Your Servant might be\nstuck with those default values while they\nhave those clothes on…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "758720"
msgid "Uhm… I don't think that's the case here.\nResetting a summoned Servant would\nbe difficult even for the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "758852"
msgid "The curse on the Mystic Code applies just once.\nThe moment it's put on, skills get reset.\nBut as payment, the curse lifts."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "758976"
msgid "…i-is that so…? I expected as much from\nhumanity's oldest King of Heroes.\nIt can't be revealed so easily."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "759084"
msgid "Yes. Please do your best with all this,\n#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. You know, the relationship with a\nServant is the Master's personal problem."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "759228"
msgid "I think that although that gold person's\nServant Rank is EX, there are too many\nissues with his disposition and state…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "759348"
msgid "Oh, so that's how that works.\nThen there's no problem.\nThink of it as good fortune, rather."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "759440"
msgid "How masochistic are you!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "759468"
msgid "Where is there good fortune!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "759500"
msgid "It's good fortune."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "759520"
msgid "Go from start to finish. From the weakest,\nbecome the strongest. From nothing, grow\nto overcome your dilemma―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "759636"
msgid "As to whose strong suit that is,\nyou should know full well who,\nhaving fought beside #[him][her]#, #C236196003#SVT#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "759760"
msgid "As to whose strong suit that is,\nyou should know full well who,\nhaving fought beside #[him][her]#, #C236196003#SVT#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "759884"
msgid "As to whose strong suit that is,\nyou should know full well who,\nhaving fought beside #[him][her]#, #C236196003#SVT#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "760008"
msgid "As to whose strong suit that is,\nI know full well who."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "760064"
msgid "You said that rehabilitation is your\nMaster's job, right, #C236196003King of Heroes#CDEF?\nPlease, worry no―――erm, watch #[him][her]# closely."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "760212"
msgid "The Master you chose is a person of\nexceptional nature, you see."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "760280"
msgid "Oh? I hear you, child.\nI shall take my time in ascertaining that truth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "760352"
msgid "Now then, let's renew the exploration.\nKnowing you two, I believe you'll turn this\nadversity into a positive thing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "760468"
msgid "It feels strange that #C236196003Leo#CDEF knows more details\nabout #C236196003#SVT#CDEF and #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF than myself,\ngiven my hazy memory.\nI can't let it stop me though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "760660"
msgid "It feels strange that #C236196003Leo#CDEF knows more details\nabout #C236196003#SVT#CDEF and #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF than myself,\ngiven my hazy memory.\nI can't let it stop me though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "760852"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF feels bitter about being reset,\nbut is still crushing through these\nhostile programs with ease despite that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "760984"
msgid "As I recall the reliable sight of #SVT[her][his][her][zasshu's]# back…\n#C236196003#SVT[Saber][Archer][Caster][Gilgamesh]##CDEF takes a deep sigh,\nlowering #SVT[her][his][her][zasshu's]# shoulders feebly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "761192"
msgid "…so I wasn't the only one with troubles.\nPraetor, you… no. No need to say it now.\nWe'll talk about it once we're out of here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "761320"
msgid "…looks like I wasn't worrying for nothing.\nMaster, we need to talk later.\nFirst, let's get out of here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "761428"
msgid "…*sigh*. I feel a tad down. Yet, you may\nbe suffering even more, Darling.\nLet's leave that discussion for later."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "761544"
msgid "…it sounds like #C236196003#SVT#CDEF noticed, as I thought."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "761608"
msgid "There are discrepancies in our memories and experiences.\nHuge gaps between my memories and\n#C236196003#SVT#CDEF's memories of our fights."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "761748"
msgid "Before I had even realized it,\nI had lost something important――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "761816"
msgid "I focus, enduring my desire to return quickly.\n#C236196003#SVT#CDEF also said that we would talk later."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "761920"
msgid "Right now, I need to focus on clearing this Labyrinth…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "761980"
msgid "It looks like the Arena continues past this door, though…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "762040"
msgid "I've never seen this kind of door before.\nIt's a Black ICE-type#RUBS program#RUBE wall#REND……\nIts security level is……☆?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "762168"
msgid "It's not that the counter is overflowing,\nit can't place a numerical value to it…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "762256"
msgid "This is impossible! It is not even in the\n#C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF's libraries―\nIt's a new type of wall…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "762368"
msgid "From her perspective as a #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF AI,\nthis door goes against common sense―――\nNo, apparently it's on a level that shouldn't exist."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "762520"
msgid "Watch out.\nMy gut says it's probably―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "762564"
msgid "The comms cut out midway.\nThe voices from the Student Council Room,\ndrowned out by a sandstorm-like interference, don't reach me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "762696"
msgid "―――I suddenly hear a voice and turn around,\nbut no one is behind me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "762768"
msgid "Where was that voice coming from!?\nNo, more importantly, this voice.\nIf I recall correctly―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "762868"
msgid "Welcome to my castle.\nI'm not pleased in the SLIGHTEST,\nbut I'll at least give a reception."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "762960"
msgid "…*sigh*. We meet #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF HERE?\nIt looks like things have taken a turn for\nthe worst, in more ways than one."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "763092"
msgid "You reside in this gravestone of a castle?\nEvidently, you're quite the spendthrift.\n#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, do you associate with this one?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "763236"
msgid "She was one of the Masters participating in the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF,\na #ROFS0001#RUBS  Magus#RUBE#C000246204Wizard#REND#CDEF of spectacular ability and a shoo-in to win."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "763420"
msgid "However… By the way she spoke just now,\nit sounds as if she's the ruler of the Labyrinth―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "763516"
msgid "Although I completely agree, now's not the time.\nDid I just hear this right, that this is\nYOUR castle?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "763620"
msgid "#[He][She]#'s not being insipid,\n#[he][she]#'s \"deliberately asking for it\"!\nWell, that aside…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "763716"
msgid "Hey, #C236196003Rin#CDEF?\nDid you just make a boss-like statement\njust now?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "763792"
msgid "I agree with that assessment. However, you\nalso look a fool, woman. Just now, you\nnamed yourself as this foul Labyrinth's lord?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "763920"
msgid "Yes, I'm the one who controls and rules\nover you who stubbornly survived:\ncall me the #C000246204Queen of the Moon#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "764044"
msgid "Huh!? Queen…!?\nWith a chest like that!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "764088"
msgid "Has she finally gone mad!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "764116"
msgid "Whaaat!? …well, now that you mention it,\nyou do have THOSE kind of leather boots…\nBut the whip? Where is the whip?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "764236"
msgid "Women are all the same… #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nI shouldn't have to tell you to choose\nyour friends with care. She's rather awful."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "764372"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF is the #C000246204Queen of the Moon#CDEF…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "764436"
msgid "\"Stubbornly survived\" is referring to us, I guess.\nShe's saying that she controls and rules over us…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "764540"
msgid "Unexpected criticism from the King of Heroes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "764588"
msgid "\"Stubbornly survived\" is referring to #C236196003Leo#CDEF and me, I guess.\nShe's saying that she controls and rules over us…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "764716"
msgid "Hmph. I can even tell what you're thinking.\nYou want to leave the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF,\nright?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "764828"
msgid "So, you came to this Labyrinth, the one and\nonly exit. Toooo bad though.\nI'm NEVER letting you leave."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "764932"
msgid "What would you even do, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF?\nYour skill will take you to the 2nd Round\nat best, then you'd just get whacked."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "765060"
msgid "Or is it that you've picked up a taste for\ndeath? If so―――it'll be okay if I\nindulge you here, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "765168"
msgid "…unbelievable.\nEven for me, with my hazy memory,\n#C236196003Rin#CDEF's uncharacteristic behavior comes as a huge shock."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "765292"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF did believe in meritocracy,\nbut she also had honesty and integrity.\nWhy would my rival, someone more dependable than anyone,\nhave such a cold air about her now―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "765480"
msgid "This is our castle. Whatever enters belongs\nto us. We don't let a single penny roll by,\nso get ready."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "765584"
msgid "I see the proof of her being a Master:\n#C000246204Command Seals#CDEF…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "765656"
msgid "She wants to summon #C236196003Lancer#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "765700"
msgid "She, too, is a Master? The quality of the\n#C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF has gone downhill.\nReady yourself. This is a Servant battle."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "765836"
msgid "Correct!\nNow then, it's your turn, #C236196003Lancer#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "765896"
msgid "#C236196003Lan#CDEF… #C236196003cer#CDEF?\nThat young girl with the red hair!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "765976"
msgid "Sure, #C236196003Rin#CDEF's Servant was in fact a #C236196003Lancer#CDEF,\nbut this is kind of different from what I remember…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "766104"
msgid "It's not him…? No, if we're unlucky,\nshe might be worse. Stay back, Master.\nThis girl is an anti-Heroic Spirit…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "766220"
msgid "Homicidal maniacs drunk on blood can be Heroic\nSpirits now? The quality drop wasn't only in\nMasters. Trash is being mass produced."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "766352"
msgid "I was just getting tired of boring sacrifices\ntoo. These kids looks like they'll make sweet\nsounds for me. You, pig. Your name is?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "766484"
msgid "Grr. What the hell did you just say?\nYou would treat my Praetor and I as animals?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "766568"
msgid "I don't want to consider it, but is she talking about me!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "766628"
msgid "What's wrong with calling a pig, a pig?\nYou should be honored, instead. I'm here calling\nyour name, see? At least climax for me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "766760"
msgid "Go on, quickly. Squeal, \"oiiiinnnkk.\"\nSqueal, now. I'm telling you to squeal.\nPlease squeal. Won't you squeal?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "766872"
msgid "This wasn't what I was promised, manager!\nAgh, enough! My headache won't stop…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "766956"
msgid "The Servant starts tearing out her own hair."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "767004"
msgid "…she's been spewing nonsense,\nbut her eyes are filled with madness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "767076"
msgid "Even a novice like myself can tell that this\nred girl has defeated countless Servants."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "767164"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF can probably detect the waft of blood\ncoming from #C236196003Lancer#CDEF better than I can."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "767280"
msgid "Hey, #C236196003Lancer#CDEF, relax. It happens sometimes, they\ndon't listen to what you say. It happens\nsometimes, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "767404"
msgid "Look, a good impalement will solve everything.\nAnyone will squeal after a stab from your lance.\nPhysically."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "767512"
msgid "―――Y-you're right. You're incredible, #C236196003Rin#CDEF.\nI'm your ally, and the way you flip out\nstill terrifies me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "767636"
msgid "I should be saying that, #C236196003Lancer#CDEF. You have\na reliably hot temper, so much so that I wonder\nif you might actually be a #C000246204Berserker#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "767796"
msgid "Hee hee hee.\nI won't pay you even if you compliment me, #C236196003Rin#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "767876"
msgid "Hee hee. That goes for you too.\nI'll squeeze as much free labor out of you as\nI can today too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "767972"
msgid "Hmhmhm―――ahahahhahaha!\nYour comebacks are the best!\nI have so much fun with you, #C236196003Rin#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "768080"
msgid "Yes, about as much fun as losing everything\nin the stock market!\nAhahahahahahahahahahahahahahaha!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "768180"
msgid "Wh―――what a combination! Praetor, they're\nin perfect harmony! If no one plays the straight\nman here, they'll play dumb forever!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "768312"
msgid "Why has it―――come to this―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "768348"
msgid "T-they compliment each other so well…!\nThey're both tsunderes!\nAh, that joke is a bit worn out, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "768456"
msgid "Honestly, I want to pretend like I saw nothing and just leave,\nbut that Servant's strength and bloodlust is the real deal."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "768580"
msgid "What do we do? Should we fight or run―――?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "768628"
msgid "Retreat for now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "768648"
msgid "You did well stopping yourself.\nWe still have way too little information to\nbe fighting an unknown opponent."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "768760"
msgid "Very well. Normally I would tear your limbs for\ngiving me such a displeasing instruction, but a\nsmall #[man][girl]# should cling to #[his][her]# small life."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "768920"
msgid "I agree with my Servant.\nIf all else fails, retreat. Or something like that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "769000"
msgid "We don't know our opponents abilities or who they are;\nand more, our stats are reduced."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "769088"
msgid "Challenging them here won't accomplish anything."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "769140"
msgid "…besides, while hard to believe, #C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Lancer#CDEF\nare so busy laughing that they don't notice what we're doing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "769284"
msgid "…slowly, quietly we'll retreat,\nuntil we're sufficiently far enough,\nand then we make a break for it――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "769392"
msgid "Ahahahaha… Hm, huh?\n#C236196003Lancer#CDEF, where's that sucker at?\nYou didn't defeat #[him][her]# already, did you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "769512"
msgid "Y-you're the last person I want to hear\nthat from!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "769564"
msgid "We run through the Labyrinth,\nputting #C236196003Rin#CDEF and that red Servant's voices behind us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "769664"
msgid "They don't seem to be chasing us,\nbut this brings up two new mysteries."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "769736"
msgid "That door blocking our way,\nand the completely changed #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "769820"
msgid "From the way #C236196003Rin#CDEF spoke, she's the ruler of this Labyrinth\nand the mastermind who trapped us in the school building."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "769952"
msgid "Just what on Earth happened to her, I wonder―――?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "770004"
msgid "We shall take the initiative!\nLeave it to me, I'll have them begging\nfor mercy!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "770084"
msgid "True, she doesn't look like the type you want\nto turn your back to. Let's do it.\nGuide me well, Master…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "770192"
msgid "―――You have erred, mongrel. No matter.\nThis is your battle.\nI'll accompany you in this last farce."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "770296"
msgid "Go, #C236196003Lancer#CDEF! This is a good chance to skewer\nthese level 1 rookies like sausages―\nTurn them into sausages!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "770420"
msgid "Loud and clear, #C236196003Rin#CDEF.\nThose who don't think are less than fattened\npigs; they're as worthless as rats."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "770540"
msgid "Damn!\nNow that she mentions it, I had forgotten!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "770592"
msgid "Ah, uh oh.\nNow that she mentions it,\nI forgot all about being reset鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "770664"
msgid "The Servants clash.\nThe outcome was decided surprisingly easily.\n#C236196003#SVT#CDEF is defeated, unable to do a thing.\nAnd I can't even save my Servant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "770820"
msgid "…a Servant's death means the Master's death.\nI no longer have any strength left…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "770904"
msgid "…*sigh*. I was kind enough to TELL you how\nweak you had become, and yet here we are."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "770992"
msgid "This happens when you don't listen to my advice.\nI'm going to ready a cage you won't be able to\nleave, for sure this time. Reflect on things."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "771136"
msgid "…my consciousness falls into darkness.\nActually, the darkness is creeping up on me…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "771224"
msgid "What just happened?\nThe functions I normally should've been able\nto use didn't exist as they should have."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "771332"
msgid "Ahh, I knew it―――\nSomething about this world is strange―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "771400"
msgid "Hm. A mind-numbing, scarlet fragrance… Praetor,\nbe cautious. Something wicked seems to lie\nbefore us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "771504"
msgid "…this scent of blood isn't even hidden.\nWatch out, Master. I expect this area to be\nvery dangerous."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "771608"
msgid "Hm? Things feel wet and slippery… Darling,\nthere is a nasty presence ahead!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "771688"
msgid "Ho―――Instigative from the start, are they?\nCan you see all the red in the air, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "771796"
msgid "…#C236196003Sakura#CDEF, please scan that building.\nCan you ascertain anything?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "771880"
msgid "Well, the thing is… that building alone is\ndifficult to scan."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "771944"
msgid "That structure is different from the rest,\nas if it was extended out from behind…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "772028"
msgid "That sounds more than suspicious.\n#C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Lancer#CDEF's secret room, maybe?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "772132"
msgid "To break through that shield, #C236196003Rin#CDEF's \"secrets\"\nare necessary―――That's what #C236196003Kiara#CDEF said."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "772256"
msgid "Yes, I would like more information, even just\na crumb of it. Please investigate, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "772364"
msgid "But be very careful. We never know when Miss\n#C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF and #C236196003Lancer#CDEF might try to start a fight."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "772488"
msgid "To the next floor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "772508"
msgid "After creating a shortcut to the\nold school building via the Checkpoint,\nplease head on back here."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd,unk_op1653
msgctxt "772608"
msgid "Return to the old school?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "772636"
msgid "Return to the old school."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "772664"
msgid "Stop.\nPlease direct your attention to the\nfountain-like object in front of you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "772744"
msgid "It is a #C000246204Revival Fountain#CDEF.\nWhen used, both Master and Servant\nwill instantly regain all of their strength."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "772868"
msgid "No, if it's a structure, then its functions\nshould be able to be rewritten externally……\nPlease wait a moment."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "772980"
msgid "―――It's done. A #C000246204Save Function#CDEF has been\nadded to the #C000246204Revival Fountains#CDEF.\nPlease use it to #C000246204Save#CDEF within the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "773148"
msgid "Good. I'd like the same feature to be\ninstalled into the Near Side's #C000246204Arena#CDEF.\nGood kids should only do an hour a day."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "773280"
msgid "I see there's another enemy.\nAll right, let's make sure you know\nhow to handle combat."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "773368"
msgid "Let's put this into practice.\nIf you keep at it, then you'll win.\nGo forth without fear."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "773460"
msgid "The quick #C000246204ATTACK#CDEF is easily countered \nby one's #C000246204GUARD#CDEF. …that, or defending\nagainst unexpected attacks, you see."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "773604"
msgid "With the appropriate responses,\neven the greatest of enemy attacks\nwill never reach their full potential."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "773712"
msgid "Also, if you chain 3 successful actions,\nyou will perform a special additional attack.\nIt is called an #C000246204EXTRA TURN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "773844"
msgid "In any case, the enemy was dealt with,\nso let's continue on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "773908"
msgid "Oh my…… This Labyrinth \nhas a surprisingly convenient layout.\nThis will make things easy to explain."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "774012"
msgid "Ahh, ahem. It seems the enemy this time\nwill only perform #C000246204GUARD#CDEF.\nIt's a program that will only defend itself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "774140"
msgid "Splendid, a job well done.\nThat's all the fundamentals of combat."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "774208"
msgid "You may have realized it by now,\nbut the three types of attacks have a\ntriangular relationship."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "774304"
msgid "The large blow from a #C000246204BREAK#CDEF crushes\nthe protective stance of a #C000246204GUARD#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "774408"
msgid "Your job is to utilize that triangle to\ndesignate six effective moves."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "774480"
msgid "Enemies will similarly choose six moves\nbased on their various patterns of thought."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "774564"
msgid "You won't see the entire pattern initially,\nbut as you defeat many of the same enemy,\nyou'll be able to see those moves in time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "774696"
msgid "Those are the basics of combat. You might feel\na little lost at first, but I think you'll\nget the hang of it pretty quick."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "774820"
msgid "Please wait. Before going ahead, please\ninvestigate the building in front of you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "774904"
msgid "This enemy has a more advanced thought-routine\nthan the other enemies so far. This is a good\nopportunity for your final practice."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "775036"
msgid "Utilizing the basics of combat and the\ntriangle that I explained to you will\nresult in effective moves."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "775140"
msgid "When you want a #C000246204Skill#CDEF to be used, press the\n#C000246204□ button#CDEF. Don't hesitate to use them\neven on small-time enemies… Be aggressive."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "775300"
msgid "…alright, that's all.\nPlease use the triangle and your #C000246204Skills#CDEF well\nto defeat that enemy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "775408"
msgid "Wonderful, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nI'm doubting if you actually lost\nyour memories or not!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "775500"
msgid "Lastly, I'll give you some advice on how\nto take your fighting to the next level."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "775584"
msgid "First, with the same #C000246204□ button#CDEF you use for\n#C000246204Skills#CDEF, once within your six moves you can\ndirectly support by using items and such."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "775744"
msgid "If the battle turns against you despite\nall your support, press the #C000246204L button#CDEF to run."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "775848"
msgid "Also, pressing the #C000246204R button#CDEF will automatically\nprovide directions… but I don't recommend using\nit until you know the enemy's attack patterns."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "776008"
msgid "…that's all the explanations I have for you.\nNow, let's get back to exploring the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "776104"
msgid "Re-entry into the Labyrinth, confirmed.\nRin's signal is… moving around further inside."
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "776192"
msgid "Be prudent in your exploration. Let us aim to\nreach the barrier from last time for now."
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "776280"
msgid "Hmhm… She didn't waste any time stinking up the place.\nLet's prepare to hunt a lizard, #RUBS  Master#RUBEDarling#REND."
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "776400"
msgid "I smell fresh blood… Seems we've run into\nthe hunter. Now then, what will you do?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "776484"
msgid "The moment I entered that area, a chill ran up my spine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "776544"
msgid "Splattered across the chamber: crimson.\nDripping from wall-affixed bodies: crimson.\nGradually pooling on the floor: crimson."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "776672"
msgid "A surface of crimson.\nA surface of anguish.\nThe surface of―――a sanguine prison not of this world."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "776776"
msgid "On the opposite side were the figures of people,\nsown to the wall like insect specimens."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "776868"
msgid "Blood gushed from the pierced scars on their sides,\nshoulders, and arms."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "776944"
msgid "Can you tear down that wall, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF?\n…it won't break, huh? Figures. Only the #C000246204Arena#CDEF\nadministrator can."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "777080"
msgid "…both. They are probably just like you all,\nCyber Frames captured from the Near Side."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "777168"
msgid "I would assume that those people were\nunable to escape to the old school building\nand taken prisoner in the labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "777288"
msgid "No way… Does that mean if we had slipped up\neven once, we would have ended up as one of\nthem…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "777388"
msgid "They're still conscious!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "777416"
msgid "These people, with their blood wrung out, are alive!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "777472"
msgid "It is too early to be rejoicing, Praetor.\nThey are definitely alive. Yet…\nThat makes this conduct all the more cruel."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "777592"
msgid "They're alive, but pretty much half-dead.\nFor a Master, this treatment may be more\nhorrifying than death."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "777700"
msgid "…certainly, if they are alive,\nthen it may be possible to rescue them.\nHowever, this is… way too…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "777804"
msgid "Do not fret. You have never seen this sort of\natrocity before? Then look closely―even without\ntaking his life, a man can be killed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "777940"
msgid "Still, they're alive. Maybe I can't save them\nright now, but if I can find a way to later―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "778036"
msgid "Still, they're alive. Maybe I can't save them\nright now, but if I can find a way to later―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "778132"
msgid "Come on, please give it back…\nGive it… back… give it…\nBack, back, back, give it back!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "778224"
msgid "So that's how it is. The NPCs had their\nblood… their data extracted as far as their\nself-restoration can handle―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "778340"
msgid "The Masters are having their magic circuits\nextracted. The very quality that\nmakes up a#ROFS0002#RUBS    Magi's#RUBE#C000246204 Wizard's#CDEF#REND natural-born talent."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "778508"
msgid "In the past, I fought against a Servant\nwith a similar skill."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "778572"
msgid "With Territory Creation and an A-rank\nequivalent in torturing skill… It was a\nServant specialized in killing, not combat."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "778696"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, no need to stick around.\nThere's no saving these captured Masters. Hurry\non ahead before they drag you down with them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "778840"
msgid "#C236196003Julius#CDEF' instructions were coldhearted,\nbut he didn't say them with cruelty."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "778932"
msgid "Maybe it's just my imagination, but he's acting\nlike he's genuinely concerned about #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "779048"
msgid "Beyond the window, more unnamed Masters are weeping.\nWhile wholly skewered by a lance-shaped object,\na young man―a former Master―continues wailing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "779200"
msgid "He called out for his proof as a #ROFS0001#RUBS  Magus#RUBE#C000246204Wizard#CDEF#REND,\nto get back his power to move freely in this cyberspace―\nwhat could be called the basis of his existence,\nhis [privilege]."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "779412"
msgid "…I was naive in my understanding. I still\nwasn't considering #C236196003Rin#CDEF, the self-proclaimed\n\"castle lord,\" as our enemy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "779544"
msgid "But this carnage is far too inhumane."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "779584"
msgid "As a Master, I still have yet to regain my self-awareness,\nmy strength, and even my memory."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "779676"
msgid "…however, I at least understand this.\nI must not give this carnage a pass.\nEven if #C236196003Rin#CDEF is my opponent, I have to face\nher head on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "779824"
msgid "Yes! That is what defines you, Praetor!\nYou may have lost your memories, but the luster\nof your spirit has not dulled."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "779944"
msgid "Your rage is like a blue flame.\nIn your battle with that girl, unleash that\nrage as a conflagration."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "780048"
msgid "I remember now. Despite seeming docile,\nyou actually turned out to be a soldier\nfull of righteous indignation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "780160"
msgid "I see you are angered, #RUBS  Master#RUBEDarling#REND―at this carnage,\nthe sadistic treatment of people as less than\nhuman; the debaucherous acts of a demon."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "780320"
msgid "Yes, or maybe I would become an 8 faced, 6 armed\ndemon-god! I would even fight the axis of time\nitself! …by the way―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "780440"
msgid "I did not think that lizard woman would be this\nfoolish. There is a limit to how shortsighted\nsomeone can be."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "780552"
msgid "That curse of hers, being unable to treat\nothers as human―――As a veteran yandere,\nI'll give it a seveeere roasting!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "780672"
msgid "Do not be so stiff. This is not an especially\nrare sight. It is exactly because humans prey on\none another that we have thrived so."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "780804"
msgid "To rebuke this as evil only shows how foolish\none is, oblivious to one's own standing, but…\nTHAT part of you differs slightly from that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "780944"
msgid "Is that indignation of yours a compassion\ntowards the unjust, or perhaps, a resentment\ntowards the friend you trusted?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "781064"
msgid "Whichever it is, start by weighing at least that\nwhich lies within you. Those inclined toward\nself-righteousness cannot laugh at brutality."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "781204"
msgid "…I slowly take a deep breath. Leaving my resolve\nas it is, I relax my entirely strained body."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "781300"
msgid "Even if it only takes this anger or justice stuff\nto harden my heart, my body remembers how to be\nsatisfied without fighting."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "781428"
msgid "Don't make me repeat our instructions. What good\nwill it do to stick around? If you really want\nto save them, find the source of all this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "781568"
msgid "I turn my back to the carnage and walk out.\nJust like when I was in that blackened school."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "781660"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, I understand how you feel. However,\nwe have no way of saving them right now.\nPlease bear with it and hurry ahead."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "781800"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF is right. I can't help anyone by standing\nhere. I need to focus on what I CAN do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "781904"
msgid "There's no sign of anyone in the torture chamber.\nWhen its creator #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF was defeated,\neveryone in this torture chamber was probably released."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "782068"
msgid "Dang it! I've gone and done something horrible\nand stupid. The LAST thing I should've done is\nlet #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF see such a disgraceful sight!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "782220"
msgid "She's facing the setting sun and appears to\nbe swooning in pain."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "782288"
msgid "We stayed on our guard as we stepped forward.\n#C236196003Rin#CDEF noticed us soon after and turned around."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "782396"
msgid "I really can't afford to take my eyes\noff you for a second. I'll kick you out\nof the labyrinth right now――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "782508"
msgid "Wh-what!?\nYou're all silent, looking disappointed…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "782560"
msgid "I'm the Queen of the Moon.\nI don't deal with insects like you myself!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "782632"
msgid "Well, well. How very interesting… however, it\nappears that this thing intends to defend\nthe Labyrinth. Ready yourself, Master!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "782760"
msgid "…I see. Anyway, let's bring this guy down,\nMaster. He's a little tougher than the rest. \nDon't get sloppy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "782868"
msgid "Ah. And there she goes. Also, this enemy is\nrather troublesome!\nPlease be cautious, Darling!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "782964"
msgid "So she says, and yet… to have such small fry\nfurnished for you must mean you are quite the\nhonored guest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "783072"
msgid "Well done.\nYou seem to have gotten accustomed to battling."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "783132"
msgid "The way Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF was acting just now―――\nI think it was as if we had finally seized her\nsecret."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "783252"
msgid "No, just one thing… Didn't it seem too easy?\nIt was too unexpectedly out in the open to be\nher secret."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "783356"
msgid "Secrets might be like that, more than you would\nexpect. Although, it's true that we don't know\nenough to say for sure."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "783476"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF. Where do you sense Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF is\nright now?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "783564"
msgid "Then briefly return to the Shield, and let's\ngauge Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF in our next contact with her.\nMaybe we can expose her secret this time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "783716"
msgid "Now that she's aware of us, it's possible that\nMiss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF may join up with #C236196003Lancer#CDEF. Hopefully\nwe can catch up to her before that happens…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "783888"
msgid "That cry came from down the corridor!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "783928"
msgid "\"Any more\"? \"Any more,\" you say?\nOnly humans get a second chance."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "783996"
msgid "Hey, pitiful little bunny?\nJust for you, I'll let you in on what words I\nhate the most."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "784084"
msgid "They're jailbreak; rebellion; sass.\nYou, bunny, would have been fine just\nacting cutely like a bunny!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "784188"
msgid "Huh? There's no way I'll allow for such a\nhalf-hearted ending. I won't let a sacrifice\nscamper away so easily."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "784300"
msgid "You're all cattle. Your fate is torment, a hell\nof blood levies, until I tire of it. Get it? \nThen it's time to get back in your cage!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "784436"
msgid "…alongside loud laughter, the shrieking ceased.\nUnbefitting to this cyberspace was the smell\nof fresh blood."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "784548"
msgid "The owner of those shrieks was nowhere to be found."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "784600"
msgid "Maybe #C236196003Lancer#CDEF caused that person to be\ntransported somewhere else…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "784684"
msgid "Oh? Is #C236196003Lancer#CDEF playing solo?\nWhere's Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "784768"
msgid "Oh? Unexpected visitors while I was catching an\nescapee? Isn't little old me just so great\nand so lucky!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "784876"
msgid "Wow. You're surprisingly all talk. I am shocked.\nWhile extolling the lord of this castle,\nyou were idle in preparing the defenses."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "785008"
msgid "Jeez. Like lousy Master, like lousy Servant.\nAll I see is that you don't even intend on \ndefending your castle."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "785120"
msgid "We are the unlucky ones. #C236196003Rin#CDEF may have a screw\nloose but, lookie here: I found an even\nlooser screw. The one on your head."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "785260"
msgid "I support #C236196003#SVT#CDEF's opinion."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "785304"
msgid "We were expecting #C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Lancer#CDEF to be waiting\nfor us, raring to go, in our next encounter with\nthem. This is pretty anticlimactic."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "785468"
msgid "…excuse me. You, with the plain-face.\nWhy aren't you speaking up? I graced you with a\nquestion. Reply."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "785572"
msgid "…I told you to reply. Don't you ignore me.\nWhat, got something to say!? Augh, a pet's\nmisbehavior is the owner's responsibility!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "785704"
msgid "Answer me already! You sniveling #[pig of a\nMaster][squirrel of\na Master]#!\nJust what, WHAT do you think this castle is!?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "785828"
msgid "This is the Arena… the Sakura Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "785872"
msgid "Did a murder happen here…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "785900"
msgid "Yes, the Arena! With first-class seats, only for\nselect fans! The splendiferous concert venue:\nthe Arena!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "786008"
msgid "Understand? #[Pigs][Squirrels]# like you are allowed only\nto cheer for me. Come on. Praise this beauty of\nmine. At once."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "786132"
msgid "Huh? Are you DUMBER than a #[pig][squirrel]#? How can\nthere be homicide? I'm the only human around."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "786232"
msgid "It's unthinkable that, despite being an animal\nonly capable of being eaten, it would do\nsomething like run from me. So I punished it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "786368"
msgid "Alright. Let's take this opportunity to quickly retreat.\nWe have the chance to take her on since #C236196003Rin#CDEF isn't here,\nbut I would prefer to have nothing to do with this\nServant if possible."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "786572"
msgid "――――Huh!?\nA-are you brain dead or something!?\nThat was clearly just a figure of speech!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "786664"
msgid "Start talking! Stuff like \"banning talking\"\nis absurd no matter how you look at it,\nisn't it!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "786760"
msgid "…now then, what to do? We've never dealt with this\ntype of Servant before. Should we trade blows with her\nor wait to see what happens?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "786896"
msgid "Our objective this time around is to observe and\ninvestigate #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF. To that end, fighting\nwon't add anything, but―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "787040"
msgid "Enough. Though #C236196003Rin#CDEF said she \"won't allow me to\nkill #C236196003#NICK#CDEF without her permission,\" it's\nbecome too troublesome to follow."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "787196"
msgid "And also, what is this \"#C236196003#NICK#CDEF\"? What\nlanguage is this? Is it a food? A place? An\nincantation? A pet name?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "787320"
msgid "Aaugh, using such complicated words\nmakes #C236196003Rin#CDEF a failure of an attendant! I'm so\nirritated, I'll take it out on you two!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "787456"
msgid "If you speak, she just flares up;\nif you're silent, she just flares up!\nShe's a ticking time bomb…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "787560"
msgid "Praetor. Get a hold of yourself. Do not be led\nastray by her words and actions. The commentary\naside, that Servant is truly powerful."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "787696"
msgid "…listening to her seems like a waste of time.\nRegardless, she's an enemy we have to defeat.\nGet ready, Master!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "787808"
msgid "Darling, stay calm.\nWe will not stand a chance if we lose our\ncomposure."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "787884"
msgid "Put a lid on that which stinks;\napply heat to that which hurts…\nLet us wrap things up in a flash!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "787984"
msgid "Self-destruction is but another type of bizarre\nbuffoonery. Mongrel. Brace yourself. That\nwoman's bloodlust, at least, is first-rate."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "788120"
msgid "Quite the spirited one, aren't you?\nYou're not my type, but I've taken\na liking to you, dud-Servant!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "788224"
msgid "I'll toy with you eeever so gently, then kill\nyou. Come this way, I'll send a third-rate\nServant like you straight into retirement!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "788356"
msgid "Ahahahahaha! What's with you!? How weak!\nDoes being in the #C236196003#SVT[Saber][Archer][Caster][Gorgeous]##CDEF class actually just\nmean being this tacky!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "788516"
msgid "Ahahahahaha! What's with you!? How weak!\nDoes being in the #C236196003#SVT[Saber][Archer][Caster][Gorgeous]##CDEF class actually just\nmean being this tacky!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "788676"
msgid "Ahahahahaha! What's with you!? How weak!\nDoes being in the #C236196003#SVT[Saber][Archer][Caster][Gorgeous]##CDEF class actually just\nmean being this tacky!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "788836"
msgid "Ahahahahaha! What's with you!? How weak!\nDoes being in the #C236196003#SVT[Saber][Archer][Caster][Gorgeous]##CDEF class actually just\nmean being this tacky!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "788996"
msgid "Guh… This damned girl, how can she be so thin\nyet so inhumanely strong…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "789072"
msgid "The surprises never end with this Servant,\nhuh…! Who would've thought someone looking like\nthat would be a power type…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "789196"
msgid "Wha―!? Why is she so stupidly strong!? And that\nlance is really a blunt weapon! She almost made\npatties out of us!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "789312"
msgid "Gorgeous―――!\nIncredible! It was I with the rare class this\nentire time!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "789388"
msgid "Hm. Well, that is irrelevant. Though I may be\ndebilitated, her strength still feels excessive.\nThis is no mere buffoonery, it seems!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "789524"
msgid "She's this powerful even without her Master\naround. If #C236196003Rin#CDEF had been here, we would've\nstruggled just to survive, for sure…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "789668"
msgid "Aah. It feels so good… What a wonderful look\nyou're giving me, #RUBS sweety#RUBEhuman#REND. Have you finally come\naround to respecting my noble lineage?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "789824"
msgid "\"#C000246204Noble Lineage#CDEF,\" you say?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "789868"
msgid "…what?\nCould someone looking like her actually be a\nHeroic Spirit of noble ancestry?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "789956"
msgid "Huh? #C000246204Noble#CDEF?\nWho are you speaking of? You don't mean\nyourself, right? Are you for real?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "790060"
msgid "…well, now. Her bloodline is certainly of an\nunusual mixture. She is still a mongrel but is\nundoubtedly one of high value."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "790184"
msgid "Yes, you're right! You're third-rate when it\ncomes to battle, but as an audience who promptly\nresponds to me well, you're first-rate."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "790320"
msgid "Are you curious?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "790340"
msgid "You're curious, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "790364"
msgid "You wanna know, right!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "790388"
msgid "Good call!\nVery well. If you want to know so badly,\nthen I'll tell you!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "790460"
msgid "I am, in fact, a #C000246204dragon girl#CDEF noble!\nA supersonic woman endowed with wits and\nbeauty! Everything is good in it's season――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "790600"
msgid "The #C000246204Blood Vocalist#CDEF, alighted from #C000246204János-hegy#CDEF of\nthe rolling thunder! Known far and wide across\n#C000246204Hungary#CDEF: #C236196003E#CDEF―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "790776"
msgid "Stupid-stupid-stupid! Enough, #C236196003Lancer#CDEF! What are \nyou thinking revealing your #C000246204True Name#CDEF!? Don't\ncome crying to me later!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "790928"
msgid "Now our opponent has gotten even stronger.\n#C236196003#SVT#CDEF and I couldn't stand up to #C236196003Lancer#CDEF when she was alone.\nWith #C236196003Rin#CDEF, now there's no chance of winning.\nEven running away seems hopeless…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "791160"
msgid "Ah, oops. #C000246204True Names#CDEF are private matters.\nWhen I made a contract with my manager,\nI was told not to give my name so easily."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "791300"
msgid "Not just your #C000246204True Name#CDEF! All your abilities\nshould be kept secret! You didn't blurt out\nanything else weird, did you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "791436"
msgid "I was perfect. Truly in a perfect silence.\nOr rather, we didn't even have anything on the\nlevel of a conversation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "791552"
msgid "Praetor. She stated that she was a #C000246204dragon girl#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "791616"
msgid "Master. The keyword here is #C000246204dragon girl#CDEF. \nRemember it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "791688"
msgid "A #C000246204dragon girl#CDEF, aaand, a slimy-tailed\nreptile. Hmm. I guess stuff like lizard-girl\nmonsters really do walk the Earth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "791824"
msgid "A descendant of dragons. I expected as much.\nEach generation led to more and more\ndegradation―――She is a #RUBSdemi-#RUBEsub-#RENDspecies now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "791972"
msgid "There's no way that #C236196003#NICK#CDEF… er, no,\n#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF is that capable! #[He's][She's]# fundamentally\ngood-hearted to a fault, after all!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "792132"
msgid "Oh? Then there's no issue here. If #[he's][she's]# \nreally a faulty Master, then there's nothing to\nfear after showing them a secret or two."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "792276"
msgid "And anyhow, take a look, #C236196003Rin#CDEF. These two aren't \nstrong in the slightest. After just some light\ndancing, they look all tuckered out."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "792424"
msgid "So, we could kill them here and now, no?\nThough I would like more sacrifices, feisty\nsheep are merely nuisances."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "792540"
msgid "We always take care of anyone that tries to\nleave the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF. That's our rule,\nisn't it, #C236196003Rin#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "792680"
msgid "We were ready to run, but that plan got flipped on its head."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "792744"
msgid "After #C236196003Lancer#CDEF gives her proposal,\n#C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF silently accep―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "792844"
msgid "Come on.\nAs the Queen, you may give the order."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "792892"
msgid "First, I'll crush the Servant and take them to\nthe torture chamber. I'll pluck the Master's\nlimbs off next and leave them at the entrance."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "793032"
msgid "After that, I'll capture each of the survivors\nfrom that school who comes to help, one by one,\nand kill them!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "793144"
msgid "How wonderful! Just imagining it makes my\nheadache disappear! This is what they call\n\"neglect play,\" right!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "793256"
msgid "Purposefully leaving a defeated enemy alive\nand using them as live bait to make more\nvictims―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "793356"
msgid "―――True. We could do that.\nThis #[guy][girl]# is the type that could turn the tables\non us at any moment if we let #[him][her]# go."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "793492"
msgid "Making #[him][her]# kneel before me, like those other\nMasters we captured, doesn't sound so bad."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "793592"
msgid "…I can't believe this.\nI don't know the details of how she came to be a Queen―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "793676"
msgid "But still, if even she were to become my enemy,\nI never believed that her true self would change―――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "793780"
msgid "Leeaave it to mee♪ Then first, I'll use my\nlance to turn this noodle-armed Servant into a\nmeat flavored pie―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "793896"
msgid "Still, it would be pretty boring. It's just not\nworth the effort to fight an opponent who's\nlost this many levels."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "794012"
msgid "#C000246204A Tohsaka acts always sublimely and elegantly#CDEF.\nThough we haven't used it in ages, that's my\nfamily's motto."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "794136"
msgid "Head back without me, #C236196003Lancer#CDEF. These shrimp\naren't worth the effort."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "794220"
msgid "Are you serious?\n…well, this IS your castle. If that's what you\nwant, then I'll watch over things for you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "794328"
msgid "…plus, there's no doubt about it.\n#C236196003Rin#CDEF saved us in a roundabout way."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "794416"
msgid "H-hmph. What's with that look?\nSomething good happen to you?\nAll I said was that I don't bully weaklings."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "794524"
msgid "I'm not particularly worried about you or\nanything. If you come back without learning a\nthing, I'll squeeze you for all you're worth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "794660"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF says coldly, turning her head away with\na \"hmph.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "794732"
msgid "…but at that moment.\nAn intense electric current ran through my\nleft hand."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "794808"
msgid "As if being drawn into #C236196003Rin#CDEF's chest,\nmy left hand raises itself on its own―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "794904"
msgid "Urk… wh-what is it now?\nYou're looking so sad all of a sudden."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "794968"
msgid "I-I'm telling you, stop looking at me like that!\nDidn't I tell you I was a Queen!? Come to think\nof it, you need to start calling me Queen!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "795108"
msgid "Get it? This is all just my mercy as the Queen!\nI simply let you go as an exception\nbecause beating you down would be boring!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "795236"
msgid "My goodness… #C236196003Rin#CDEF never fails to surprise me.\nI would have never thought….\nEven I have to concede in the face of this…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "795376"
msgid "Ah―――So it really is like that, huh? I\nexpected it to come to this, but who would've\nthought it would be so abrupt and blunt…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "795508"
msgid "…………I was wondering if it was possible,\nbut could it really be that she's the physical\nreincarnation of #RUBS             Ishtar#RUBEthat wicked woman#REND?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "795672"
msgid "?? Is this something?\nAn exceedingly ordinary utterance,\noriginating from a chivalrous mind?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "795768"
msgid "My eyeballs center on #C236196003Rin#CDEF's chest, and I\ntake sight of a thing rooted within her blood\nvessels."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "795880"
msgid "Eh? What's with this mood? I'm the one who let\nyou go, you know? Why are you all looking at me\nwith such pity?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "795992"
msgid "Ah―ouch!? Hey, what is this!? Out of nowhere,\nmy chest, hurts―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "796064"
msgid "Once I decided that, both my feet kicked off\nthe ground. I dashed off like an arrow,\nas if my body wasn't my own."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "796180"
msgid "Before I could even comprehend what was happening,\nmy left hand dissolves into #C236196003Rin#CDEF's wide-open chest―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "796304"
msgid "A split-second."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "796320"
msgid "Within #C236196003Rin#CDEF's chest was one of her hidden,\npersonal preferences. It raced through the\nback of my mind like a flash of light."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "796460"
msgid "Ow…\nWh-what was that, just now―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "796500"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF's body starts to fade away."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "796548"
msgid "No way… did I accidentally do lethal\ndamage to her with that touch!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "796620"
msgid "But, #C236196003Rin#CDEF has neither wounds nor is bleeding anywhere―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "796696"
msgid "Ugh… My offshoot, won't hold…\nI thought my #RUBS   Ego#RUBEdesire#REND was invincible, but you\nhad a trick up your sleeve to delete it…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "796836"
msgid "I expected no less… I despise you,\n#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF. Of course YOU would be the biggest\nobstacle between me and becoming Queen…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "796976"
msgid "Er… well, one thing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "797000"
msgid "Even if you glare at me with maximum resentment,\nI can't do much about it. Please don't go\noverestimating me whenever you feel like it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "797136"
msgid "A quarter…? Ah! Perhaps, ever since we entered\nthe Labyrinth, that sign of life I was\nreading was actually――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "797248"
msgid "So it really was! That sign of life originated\nfrom the Labyrinth itself, but the ID said\nit was #C236196003Rin#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "797368"
msgid "If we count back, I think THAT #C236196003Rin#CDEF was one part\nof her consciousness, discharged from her True\nSelf! One quarter of the Labyrinth in volume!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "797528"
msgid "That sign of Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF was from the\nLabyrinth…? No, first of all, is discharging\nher mind something she can do on her own?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "797672"
msgid "Hmph. None of you are capable of it, but\nsomeone who knows the secret of the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF\nlike me can."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "797788"
msgid "Listen here. I don't really get why I lost,\nbut I'll surrender this time around. However,\nthe last thing I'll tell you is this:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "797916"
msgid "Vanishing here is convenient for me!\nI'm absolutely not doing it for your sake,\ngot it!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "798008"
msgid "…uhm. Anyway, signs of this #C236196003Rin#CDEF have almost\ndisappeared. There are still signs of life from\nthe Labyrinth, but not dangerous ones."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "798156"
msgid "Also, I have identified #C236196003Rin#CDEF's hidden heart from\nthe data #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF obtained. The name of #C000246204SG1#CDEF,\nher personal preference, is…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "798328"
msgid "Wait. Let's leave that knowledge only to\n#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. That would be more respectful to\nMiss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "798460"
msgid "…absolutely. It even riled up the listeners…\nIt was on the level of traditional performing\narts."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "798560"
msgid "You're fine the way you are, #C236196003Gawain#CDEF.\nMore importantly, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF. What does this \"#C000246204SG#CDEF\"\nabbreviation stand for?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "798716"
msgid "Also, I detected a relatively stable structure\nbeyond the Shield."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "798784"
msgid "There, it seems you can make a #C000246204shortcut#CDEF\nto allow yourself to directly travel from\nthe cherry blossom tree."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "798908"
msgid "This is good enough.\nLet's take the rest of this search easy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "798972"
msgid "Since we've decided on our next plan,\nyou can take a breather and rest. Then, we'll\nreconvene in the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line2
msgctxt "799096"
msgid "You can access it from the Main Menu."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "799136"
msgid "This is the #C000246204Shield#CDEF from yesterday.\nAccording to #C236196003Kiara#CDEF, this is #C236196003Rin#CDEF's mental wall."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "799268"
msgid "I tried pushing on it, but it wouldn't budge.\nLike I thought, I need to locate this\n\"inner workings of #C236196003Rin#CDEF's heart\" thing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "799408"
msgid "―――I sense myself descending into an abyss."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "799456"
msgid "Our first sight was that of the\nsetting sun against the horizon\nand towering castle spires all around us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "799564"
msgid "I can't see the ground.\nA path extends out before us like a strung thread."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "799640"
msgid "A smell of iron blended with the breeze.\nAs if staining this sublime scenery is\nan unconcealable scent of blood."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "799756"
msgid "Signal confirmed.\nCan you hear me, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF?\nThis is the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "799852"
msgid "Currently, our resources are set to\nprioritize safeguarding your digital shell,\n#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "799960"
msgid "Though we call it an Arena, that there is\nthe #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF… A \"#C000246204null realm#CDEF\"\nformed out of Imaginary Numbers."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "800112"
msgid "The transmission from #C236196003Leo#CDEF is all clear."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "800168"
msgid "I wonder if \"number measurement\" and \"collapse of significance\"\nmeans that so long as they're monitoring\nme from the Student Council Room, \"my position won't be lost.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "800336"
msgid "Yes. To make a simple comparison, you're\nunderwater. Please think of it as us giving\nyou oxygen to breathe, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "800468"
msgid "The#RUBS    image#RUBE monitor#REND #RUBS     measurements#RUBEand sensors#REND are both excellent."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "800568"
msgid "The Labyrinth has the structure of an Arena.\nNow… hm? What are these bio-signs…? Bio-sign\nreadings are all across the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "800700"
msgid "Bio-signs… Basically, there are\nhumans in the Labyrinth who entered before us?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "800780"
msgid "No, since the gate was only just built,\nno lifeforms should be inside the Labyrinth.\nIf there are, then that means―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "800904"
msgid "They were in the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF from the\nstart. Or perhaps they're victims who\ncouldn't escape to the old school building."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "801048"
msgid "…I'm sorry.\nCurrently, these bio-signs are unknown."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "801104"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, can you see your map?\nYou can read your surroundings as well as\nthings like enemy readings in the area."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "801232"
msgid "…so, please take every precaution.\nIf things become dangerous, please\nreturn at once."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "801320"
msgid "As #C236196003Sakura#CDEF says. We're maintaining the\nstaircase between your current location\nand the school building right now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "801452"
msgid "If you experience any peril, head back.\nNow then, please explore the area."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "801528"
msgid "So this is the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF.\nIt's exactly like a medieval European castle,\nyet…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "801632"
msgid "Mhm, there was no need for us to worry.\nIt differs in appearance, but it seems to be\njust a normal Arena."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "801740"
msgid "Knowing that, let's warm up with some light\nswordplay. As always, I'll be counting on\nyour precise direction, #RUBS  Master#RUBEPraetor#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "801884"
msgid "Don't be so nervous, Master. It feels\nslightly different, but it's the same old Arena.\nThis should be no problem."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "802000"
msgid "As long you direct me with a cool head,\nas you always have, we'll be fine.\nThe rest is my job."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "802096"
msgid "Then basic actions should make quick work of\nthis place鷙 Okay, Darling. Let's embark on our\ntour of this tasteless castle!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "802220"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF boldly gazes over the Arena, without a shred of fear."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "802296"
msgid "…what's with this uneasiness I feel?\nCompared to me, who can hardly tell left from right,\n#C236196003#SVT#CDEF is composed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "802424"
msgid "The #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF is an unknown space to #C236196003#SVT#CDEF too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "802516"
msgid "Maybe #SVT[she][he][she][he]# can be relaxed despite that because\n#SVT[she][he][she][he]# puts absolute trust in my instructions."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "802648"
msgid "…my anxiety mounts.\nSure, I understand that #C236196003#SVT#CDEF and I are in the same boat.\nI really feel that way, too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "802772"
msgid "However――I can't find any of those memories,\nthose experiences."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "802840"
msgid "It's pathetic of me to not remember what we\ndid in the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "802928"
msgid "Did #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF truly handle these battles\nwith so much trust placed in #[him][her]#?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "803036"
msgid "Hm? What's the matter? A predicament of this\ndegree is no big deal, compared to\nthat damned #C236196003Assassin#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "803156"
msgid "Well, aren't you unusually cautious. Did\nyou recall something like #C255045045Alice#CDEF's #C000246204Reality\nMarble#CDEF? It's similar but not as bad."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "803308"
msgid "Darling? That musclehead #C236196003Berserker#CDEF isn't here.\nFear not. I get the feeling that we'll be fine\nas long as we don't screw up!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "803448"
msgid "…yeah, this is no time to be hesitating.\nI'm anxious as to if I'll live up to the trust #SVT[she][he][she][he]# \nputs in me, but right now we need to clear this Arena!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "803620"
msgid "Hmph… A rubbish design, but it'll serve fine\nto test your measure. It has everything a\nmongrel worth toying with needs."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "803744"
msgid "Now, send me your magical energy.\nLet's embark on a long awaited hunting.\nBe sure not to bore me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "803844"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF boldly gazes over the Arena without a shred of fear."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "803920"
msgid "My throat trembles out of nervousness.\nCompared to me, who can hardly tell left from right,\n#C236196003#SVT#CDEF's composure is on a different level."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "804072"
msgid "No matter how I look at it,\nI'm the follower here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "804124"
msgid "This is an unknown space to #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "804184"
msgid "Despite that, he stands majestically.\nMaybe because of those unwavering, absolute values\nhe holds in the face of anything."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "804308"
msgid "…my anxiety gradually mounts.\nI understand that #C236196003#SVT#CDEF and I are in the same boat."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "804408"
msgid "Okay… #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nWhat do you think of this torture chamber?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "804484"
msgid "Do you think it's what #C236196003Kiara#CDEF was talking about?\nIs it \"Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF's secret\" which we need\nto open up that shield?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "804632"
msgid "I think Rin's secret is the Torture Chamber."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "804680"
msgid "No, I don't think so."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "804704"
msgid "A torture chamber set up in a hidden Labyrinth…\nSomething of this scale would suit #C236196003Rin#CDEF, I think."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "804820"
msgid "She DOES look like a thorns and whips and\nstuff kind of girl.\nAlso, #C236196003Rin#CDEF is… a little scary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "804932"
msgid "Huh. That's what you think? I felt like Miss\n#C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF's secret would be something super\nknavish…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "805048"
msgid "Regardless, it's too early to say for sure.\nLet's continue searching this floor to see if\nher secrets lie somewhere else."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "805172"
msgid "I don't think this torture chamber is a secret of #C236196003Rin#CDEF's."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "805248"
msgid "#C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF is definitely a danger to be around.\nBut she was never one to do something so evil\nas this―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "805376"
msgid "My memories may be fragmented, but I'm sure\nthat I'm not wrong on that.\n……probably."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "805464"
msgid "Yes, I feel the same way. Since we're talking\nabout Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF's secrets, they must be much\nmore amusing than this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "805600"
msgid "Her secrets should be in other places.\nLet's start by #C000246204checking every nook and cranny#CDEF\nof this floor."
msgstr ""

